# Lab 7: Resilience
# Watch the response times and status codes, and the lab client's trace panel.
@host = https://localhost:7001
@dana = paste-dana-token-here

### A transient blip: the next 2 store calls fail. Before Lab 7: 500. After: 200 (retried).
PUT {{host}}/dev/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "latencyMs": 0, "errorRate": 0, "available": true, "failNextCalls": 2 }

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{dana}}

### Every call fails: 503 store-unavailable (before Lab 7: 500)
PUT {{host}}/dev/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "latencyMs": 0, "errorRate": 1, "available": true }

### Send this several times: the circuit opens, and failures become instant 503s with Retry-After
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{dana}}

### Health while the circuit is open: Degraded, still 200
GET {{host}}/health

### The store hangs: 504 after about 2.5 s (before Lab 7: waits the full 10 s)
PUT {{host}}/dev/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "latencyMs": 10000, "errorRate": 0, "available": true }

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{dana}}

### Back to normal (the circuit closes after its break duration)
POST {{host}}/dev/chaos/reset
